{
  "name": "Close Quarters Combatant",
  "type": "archetypes",
  "img": "icons/svg/statue.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You prefer to fight up close and personal.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers/Qualities</div><p>Assign one of the dice you rolled at the end of the power source step to the @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.JbpF0zq2JHhwxVHD]{Close Combat} quality. If you already have @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.JbpF0zq2JHhwxVHD]{Close Combat}, either skip it or swap the die with one of your new dice.</p><p>Assign one or more of the remaining dice to any of these powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p><p>Assign any remaining dice to any of these qualities:</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p><p>• Select from Social qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain three of the following Green abilities, at least one using your @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.JbpF0zq2JHhwxVHD]{Close Combat} quality and another using one of your powers:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.gMkBe1mXVKyu4zm1]{Defensive Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.yaLfbb57ErrXxB9Y]{Dual Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.iR33NU0dvSPnBScs]{Flexible Stance}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.B8OfLL4KymIFH3Q3]{Offensive Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.1aSE4cepOZeERVUM]{Precise Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.MsdT3THHgZncutO9]{Throw Minion}</li></ul><p>Gain one of the above abilities as a Yellow ability, using a different power or quality from any of your Green abilities.</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.etrC2PptpxWmJFDX]{Defensive Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.7VEpTEuo4M1wk9Xf]{Dual Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.SxTvDxGQHwMvnfmE]{Flexible Stance}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ksKOGeP9HawmmwHg]{Offensive Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.KtcPmbpQYHH0f0CE]{Precise Strike}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.D5oWlBPmtqBT8Ysl]{Throw Minion}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose a Responsibility principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Personality</div><p>Roll d10, d10 for personality selection.</p></section>"
  },
